// Title: Suspicious Parent Double Extension File Execution
// Rule ID: 5e6a80c8-2d45-4633-9ef4-fa2671a39c5c
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1036.007
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_susp_double_extension_parent.yml
